      "onFloor": true
    },
    "wakeShot": 1,
    "lines": [
      "Ratchet’s spare cell fits the port in his chest. You seat it.",
      "Mrrow… power! A working unit — and a cat, no less. I’m Old Servo, keeper of this winding house. Tell Ratchet thank you.",
      "After his marble? It’s under us. The hub east of here has a loose floor at its west end — break through it and the caves open up.",
      "And a favour, if you have legs for it: my gantry coil shook loose up in the gantries. The climb starts right behind me. Bring it back and I’ll pay you 60 scrap and 10 IQ.",
      "Errand taken"
    ],
    "after": {
      "live": true,
      "q": "active",
      "cells": 0
    },
    "repeat": [
      "Mrrow. Little frame. Nothing your size has come back up that corridor.",
      "My receiver was unplugged inside the shielded lift housing when the song changed.",
      "I spent the last charge holding the bridge for the workers. Counted them across. Kept counting after the motor stopped.",
      "Ratchet sent a spare? Tell him the last passenger got home.",
      "Bring me: a shaken-loose coil",
      "The coil is up in the gantries — the climb starts right behind me.",
      "(not yet)"
    ],
    "thanks": [
      "That’s my coil! Listen — the drum turns true again. Here: 60 scrap and 10 IQ, as promised."
    ],
    "paid": {
      "q": "done",
      "scrap": 60,
      "joy": 2.2502333333332967,
      "spin": true
    }
